        <li><strong>Songbook:</strong> Bookmark prepared bhajans with your preferred vocal scales.</li>
        <li><strong>1-Click Submissions:</strong> Your name is verified and locked on submission pages.</li>
        <li><strong>90-Day Stay-In:</strong> You remain logged in for 90 days on this device.</li>
